                  "type": "MATCH",
                  "page_ref": "p.26"
                },
                {
                  "stem": "Brahma-knowledge and Buddha's Dhamma",
                  "type": "MATCH",
                  "page_ref": "p.26"
                },
                {
                  "stem": "Sunny golden land",
                  "type": "MATCH",
                  "page_ref": "p.26"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "task_text": "The poet uses imagery (descriptive language to create vivid mental pictures that appeal to the senses). Give any two examples from the poem.",
              "question_bank": []
