                },
                {
                  "stem": "The sight of such beauty is very inviting and has to be captured → Speaker ___",
                  "type": "MATCH",
                  "page_ref": "p.31"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "speaking": {
          "section_name": "Speaking Activity",
          "tasks_verbatim": [
            {
              "task_text": "In pairs, take turns to speak about the aspects of your village/town/city that you feel are an asset. It could be about geographical, cultural, traditional features, or even its history. Use the provided cues to express your praise and admiration. [Cues: 'One thing that I find truly wonderful about my village/town/city is...'; 'If I had to describe my village/town/city in one word, it would be...'; 'I have always been fascinated by the way the people of my village/town/city...'; 'What I want other people to know about my village/town/city is…'; 'When it comes to the scenery, my village/town/city truly shines because...'; 'I feel a deep sense of pride when I think about my village/town/city...']",
              "question_bank": []
